* {{IPA|/kaʁˈtɔfəl/|[kaʁˈtɔfl̩]|[kaɐ̯-]|[-fəl]|lang=de}} {{i|standard}}
* {{IPA|/kɐˈtɔfəl/|lang=de}} {{i|common}}
